---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
import credits from '../data/photo-credits.json';
import { url } from '../lib/urls';
---
<BaseLayout title="Photography & credits" description="Photography sources, image licenses, and open-source typefaces used by Tampa Curated."><PageIntro number="COLOPHON" title="THE CREDITS" deck="Good work deserves a name. The photographs and typefaces behind this edition."/><div class="prose" style="max-width:800px;margin-top:30px"><p>All photographs are licensed stock imagery, downloaded and served locally. They are cropped and, in some layouts, treated in monochrome or duotone. Only the Tampa images explicitly identified below document Tampa. Other photographs illustrate fictional content; the models are not the named fictional profiles, and no endorsement or affiliation is implied.</p></div><table class="credits-table"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Image</th><th scope="col">Photographer</th><th scope="col">Source</th><th scope="col">License</th></tr></thead><tbody>{credits.map(credit=><tr><td>{credit.key.replaceAll('-',' ')}</td><td>{credit.photographer}</td><td><a href={credit.source}>Original photograph ↗</a></td><td><a href={credit.license}>{credit.source.includes('unsplash')?'Unsplash':'Pexels'} license ↗</a></td></tr>)}</tbody></table><div class="prose" style="max-width:800px;margin-bottom:40px"><h2>The archival map</h2><p>The tracing-table experiment uses sheet 1 of the <a href="https://www.loc.gov/item/sanborn01352_002/">Sanborn Fire Insurance Map of Tampa, June 1887</a>. Credit: Library of Congress, Geography and Map Division, Sanborn Maps Collection. The Library identifies this collection as public domain and free to use and reuse. The colored tracing and annotations are our own interpretive drawings.</p><h2>The type</h2><p><strong>Anton</strong> by Vernon Adams. <strong>Barlow Condensed</strong> by Jeremy Tribby. <strong>Libre Caslon Text</strong> by Impallari Type. Distributed through Fontsource under the SIL Open Font License 1.1; all fonts are served locally.</p><p>License files: <a href={url('licenses/anton.txt')}>Anton</a>, <a href={url('licenses/barlow-condensed.txt')}>Barlow Condensed</a>, <a href={url('licenses/libre-caslon-text.txt')}>Libre Caslon Text</a>.</p><h2>Art direction</h2><p>Original design for Tampa Curated, inspired by the print composition of the supplied Transmission Magazine reference. No Transmission branding, photographs, or editorial content are reproduced.</p></div><section class="prose" style="max-width:800px;margin-bottom:40px"><h2>Spatial drawing</h2><p>The Unfinished City uses original procedural architecture and the publication’s existing mechanical geometry. Three.js is distributed under the <a href={url('licenses/three.txt')}>MIT license</a>. Its architectural surroundings are imagined; the Ybor photograph retains the credit listed above.</p></section></BaseLayout>
